## What This Adds

**11-Stage Feature Lifecycle:**
1. idea → 2. feature (WHAT+WHY) → 3. spec (HOW) → 4. plan (order) → 5. tasks (executable) → 6-10. reviews → 11. done

**Files:**
- `work-state.md` — Features table (shared with brain plugin)
- `.features/<id>/` — feature.md, spec.md, plan.md, tasks.md, *.review.md (created by skills)

**Skills:**
- `/lifecycle:write-feature|spec|plan|tasks` — Write each artifact
- `/lifecycle:review-feature|spec|plan|tasks|code` — Review before approval
- `/lifecycle:full-prime` — Session start (show all features + suggestions)
- `/lifecycle:plan-product` — Turn idea into product roadmap
- `/lifecycle:archive-feature` — Move completed to archive

**Agents (Claude Code):**
- `write-feature`, `write-spec`, `write-plan`, `write-tasks` — Stage-specific writers
- `reviewer` — Dispatches reviews by artifact type

